## STEP-BY-STEP IMPLEMENTATION

### STEP 1: Update Site Metadata

**File to edit:** `app/layout.tsx` or equivalent Next.js layout file

**Changes:**
```
FROM: <title>Brainsty Health Navigator</title>
TO:   <title>Brainsty — AI Healthcare Concierge | Know Your Real Costs</title>

FROM: <meta name="description" content="Human-inspired biotech to support you in your health journey." />
TO:   <meta name="description" content="AI-powered healthcare concierge. Know your real costs. Prevent surprise bills. Optimize your benefits. Independent — no insurer or provider ties." />
```

**Add Open Graph tags:**
```html
<meta property="og:title" content="Brainsty — Your Healthcare Intelligence" />
<meta property="og:description" content="Stop guessing about healthcare costs. Brainsty is an AI concierge that works for you." />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://brainsty.ai" />
```

